---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Analysis & Results | NutriBean+">
  <main class="page-container">

    <!-- ================= CONCLUSIONS ================= -->
    <section class="conclusions-header">

      <h1>CONCLUSIONS</h1>

      <p class="conclusions-lead">
        With the conclusion of the project and its analysis, we have
        highlighted the following results:
      </p>

      <ul class="conclusions-list">
        <li>
          Enhancement of vegetable protein sources, in particular from
          soy and chickpeas, as an alternative to those of animal origin.
        </li>

        <li>
          Low Water &amp; Carbon Footprint.
        </li>

        <li>
          Negligible chemical treatments compared to other crops.
        </li>

        <li>
          The contents of the soybean varieties of W.A.C., O.A.C.,
          total polyphenols, antioxidant activity, proteins and lipids
          are higher than those of the chickpeas.
        </li>

        <li>
          The waste has a good protein content (27.66%), the highest
          content of W.A.C., O.A.C., total polyphenols, antioxidant
          activity and negligible concentration of lipids (0.32%).
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="conclusions-summary">
        To sum up, we discovered the high potential hidden inside these
        pods, demonstrating how even wastes can be useful, thus
        encouraging an environmentally-friendly economy.
      </p>

    </section>


    <!-- ================= PROJECT VIDEO ================= -->
    <section
      class="video-showcase"
      aria-label="NutriBean+ presentation video"
    >

      <div class="video-box">

        <video
          controls
          preload="none"
          playsinline
          poster="/video-cover.jpg"
          aria-label="NutriBean+ presentation video"
        >
          <source src="/video.mp4" type="video/mp4" />

          Your browser does not support HTML video.
        </video>

      </div>

    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>

